  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "If you want to share a little bit about your background and you know what you're looking for.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 0.16,
      "end_time": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And then I just have a few questions.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 5.76,
      "end_time": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 8.56,
      "end_time": 8.92
    },
    {
      "text": "We're six weeks into the project, so I was looking for you guys to give me an update.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 8.92,
      "end_time": 12.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Really more than me.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 12.28,
      "end_time": 13.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Share who I am and what I'm looking for.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 13.12,
      "end_time": 14.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 15.52,
      "end_time": 16.08
    },
    {
      "text": "All righty.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 17.28,
      "end_time": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "So let me just go.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 18.08,
      "end_time": 20.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And I think maybe it would be better than if I just connected because I'm sorry, I just kind of came on.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 21.12,
      "end_time": 30.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So let me just get some more information from Shams and then is it.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 30.76,
      "end_time": 36.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 36.32,
      "end_time": 36.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Could we.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 36.84,
      "end_time": 37.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I think basically the.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 39.4,
      "end_time": 41.08
    },
    {
      "text": "What we want to do is I know some of the leads that were being sent to you previously are.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 41.64,
      "end_time": 47.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Are not what you're looking for.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 47.36,
      "end_time": 49.16
    },
    {
      "text": "So I just wanted to gather a little bit more information about what it is that you're looking for so that I can go in, clean up the list and make sure that we're targeting the rest.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 49.8,
      "end_time": 59.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, what's coming through just now is a whole lot of people who want to raise one hundred and two hundred thousand pounds and that makes no money at all.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 60,
      "end_time": 67.48
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no use to us.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 67.48,
      "end_time": 68.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's stop with.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 68.68,
      "end_time": 70.12
    },
    {
      "text": "We are looking to fundraise and just focus on.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 70.12,
      "end_time": 72.52
    },
    {
      "text": "We want to sell companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 72.52,
      "end_time": 73.6
    },
    {
      "text": "That's probably the big thing.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 74.08,
      "end_time": 75.6
    },
    {
      "text": "That.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 76,
      "end_time": 76.4
    },
    {
      "text": "That's kind of the big thing, I'd say, because that we're not getting anybody who's looking to sell companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 76.48,
      "end_time": 82.6
    },
    {
      "text": "We're getting everybody who's looking at this time of year and in the market that we're in, I could get a million people who want to raise money that I would never say yes to because they've been around the market and they're rubbish leads etc and rubbish businesses and they'll never raise any funds.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 82.6,
      "end_time": 98.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So what I want is people that are going to sell businesses.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 98.28,
      "end_time": 102.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So probably the most important thing very, very quickly is changing that we do fundraising and take that off everything to.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 102.4,
      "end_time": 112.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you looking to sell your business?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 112.33,
      "end_time": 113.93
    },
    {
      "text": "That.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 114.33,
      "end_time": 114.65
    },
    {
      "text": "That's probably the key thing I'd like to.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 114.65,
      "end_time": 117.57
    },
    {
      "text": "To go through.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 117.57,
      "end_time": 118.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 119.05,
      "end_time": 119.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 119.93,
      "end_time": 120.57
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'll.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 120.97,
      "end_time": 121.85
    },
    {
      "text": "And how.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 122.33,
      "end_time": 122.85
    },
    {
      "text": "And how quickly can we start that moving?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 122.85,
      "end_time": 124.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the promise was lots of leads very quickly, and that's not happening.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 124.89,
      "end_time": 133.13
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm what, five, six weeks in?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 133.21,
      "end_time": 134.93
    },
    {
      "text": "And we've got eight, eight meetings in total.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 134.93,
      "end_time": 137.56
    },
    {
      "text": "We've had eight people looking for raising 100 to.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 137.56,
      "end_time": 142.68
    },
    {
      "text": "To £300,000 in revenue or they just want to chat and they've got no interest in selling, which is fine, I can get that.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 142.84,
      "end_time": 150.84
    },
    {
      "text": "But if that's the case, then we need volume and we need it quickly, otherwise this is a waste of money, unfortunately.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 150.84,
      "end_time": 157.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 160.12,
      "end_time": 160.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And disappointment that Andrew's not here, considering this has been set up for over a week, this meeting.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 160.68,
      "end_time": 166.07
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 166.79,
      "end_time": 167.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 167.99,
      "end_time": 168.71
    },
    {
      "text": "I can see if he can.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 169.75,
      "end_time": 171.19
    },
    {
      "text": "Let.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 171.51,
      "end_time": 171.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me see if he can jump on and if.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 171.87,
      "end_time": 174.31
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, it's okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 174.39,
      "end_time": 175.35
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd rather we go away and come back with a plan, because at the moment, after four weeks, five weeks, it's not working.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 175.51,
      "end_time": 183.83
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 184.39,
      "end_time": 184.79
    },
    {
      "text": "And.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 186.95,
      "end_time": 187.35
    },
    {
      "text": "And you guys aren't doing anything to help.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 187.35,
      "end_time": 189.11
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no customer service, there's no support.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 190.4,
      "end_time": 192.32
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no reach out to see what's going well.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 192.8,
      "end_time": 194.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Not going well.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 194.88,
      "end_time": 195.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'm the one who seems to be driving everything, which is fine.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 197.76,
      "end_time": 201.04
    },
    {
      "text": "But if all you want is 2 months of 4k, then that's all you're going to get, really, Unless things start improving.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 201.44,
      "end_time": 209.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 210.48,
      "end_time": 210.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I think that's also why Andy wanted me to be on this call.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 211.44,
      "end_time": 215.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Just because I'll be the point of contact moving forward, and I'm going to be.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 215.12,
      "end_time": 219.59
    },
    {
      "text": "What's that?",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 222.63,
      "end_time": 223.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you just joined?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 223.43,
      "end_time": 224.47
    },
    {
      "text": "I've been on for a few months with.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 225.91,
      "end_time": 228.59
    },
    {
      "text": "With the team.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 228.59,
      "end_time": 229.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 229.59,
      "end_time": 230.07
    },
    {
      "text": "So I guess.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 231.03,
      "end_time": 231.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Why haven't we been in tape support?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 231.63,
      "end_time": 233.11
    },
    {
      "text": "Why has it taken five weeks?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 233.11,
      "end_time": 234.63
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 236.39,
      "end_time": 236.79
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm gonna just get some more answers from the team just to see what's.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 237.99,
      "end_time": 242.55
    },
    {
      "text": "What's going on.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 242.55,
      "end_time": 243.35
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 243.99,
      "end_time": 244.39
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm really sorry.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 244.39,
      "end_time": 245.43
    },
    {
      "text": "We want this.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 246.59,
      "end_time": 247.07
    },
    {
      "text": "We want.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 247.07,
      "end_time": 247.51
    },
    {
      "text": "We really want this to work.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 247.51,
      "end_time": 248.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Daniel sold us a great vision of what you guys do, but so far it's not doing that.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 249.15,
      "end_time": 257.79
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 257.95,
      "end_time": 258.59
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not the reality.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 258.59,
      "end_time": 259.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 260.35,
      "end_time": 260.91
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'd like to maybe see the reality.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 261.23,
      "end_time": 265.15
    },
    {
      "text": "So if we can maybe change the messages.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 265.79,
      "end_time": 267.71
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't want fundraising at all because all those leads coming through are absolutely pointless.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 267.71,
      "end_time": 272.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's see if we can try and change it to who's going to sell if we need to widen the net.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 272.97,
      "end_time": 277.05
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to widen the net, but we need.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 277.05,
      "end_time": 278.65
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to start getting some feedback and we need to start having discussions about what's working, what's not working from your side.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 278.81,
      "end_time": 284.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 285.53,
      "end_time": 285.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 285.89,
      "end_time": 286.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 286.33,
      "end_time": 286.97
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, I'm going to change this.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 287.45,
      "end_time": 291.45
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to change this for you.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 291.45,
      "end_time": 292.65
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to turn things around.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 292.65,
      "end_time": 293.77
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to be your point of contact moving forward.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 294.41,
      "end_time": 298.17
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'm going to connect with the team now and see what's going on.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 299.21,
      "end_time": 304.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to change that messaging that you mentioned so that will get updated, and then from there we can.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 305.28,
      "end_time": 314.48
    },
    {
      "text": "We can do another call, if that works.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 314.56,
      "end_time": 318.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 319.44,
      "end_time": 319.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's have a weekly call until the end of the four week.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 320.32,
      "end_time": 324.4
    },
    {
      "text": "The next four weeks?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 324.4,
      "end_time": 325.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 325.68,
      "end_time": 326.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So that we can see exactly what's being delivered.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 326.08,
      "end_time": 328.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And what.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 328.2,
      "end_time": 328.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Why is it working?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 328.73,
      "end_time": 329.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Why is it not working?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 329.33,
      "end_time": 330.25
    },
    {
      "text": "What's.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 330.25,
      "end_time": 330.73
    },
    {
      "text": "What's happening?",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 330.73,
      "end_time": 331.37
    },
    {
      "text": "That's kind of what I was expecting.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 331.37,
      "end_time": 332.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 335.21,
      "end_time": 336.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Spending £4,000amonth.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 336.57,
      "end_time": 338.13
    },
    {
      "text": "I was expecting a lot more, to be honest.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 338.13,
      "end_time": 339.73
    },
    {
      "text": "But let's.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 339.73,
      "end_time": 341.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's see if you can fix it and then we can see if it can actually work for us.",
      "speaker_name": "Gary Smith",
      "start_time": 341.29,
